		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Four-armed and human- sized. Brass and steel automaton that performs repairs and tasks. It speaks its creator's language.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 7, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +1 (1d4) or repair, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Clockwork</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from fire, cold, or non-magical sources. Double damage from electricity.</p><p></p><p><strong>Repair</strong>. INT 15+ to repair a clockwork, which regains 1d10 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
